; Stray review/patch working files (see issue #132) accidentally swept into
; the 2.1.3 tarball because they were untracked in the working directory
; when it was built. GatherDir is not git-aware, so guard against them here.
\.patch$
^(feedback|patch)-\d+\.md$
^\d+-review\.md$
